    <!-- Interrogative adverbs (OLiA: InterrogativeAdverb) — re-classed from the `pron` mis-tag; `when` also keeps its subordinator entry below. Each carries a DISTINCT synset (not a shared `fw-interrogative-adv`) so `wh_adverb_role_from_synset` can decode the manner/reason/place/time feature — Cysouw (2004) §3.2 table (9): how→MANNER, why→REASON, where→PLACE, when→TIME. The `subcat` stays the shared OLiA `InterrogativeAdverb` fragment. -->
    <LexicalEntry id="fw-where"><Lemma writtenForm="where" partOfSpeech="r"/><Sense id="fw-where-1" synset="fw-interrogative-adv-place" subcat="InterrogativeAdverb"/></LexicalEntry>
    <LexicalEntry id="fw-how"><Lemma writtenForm="how" partOfSpeech="r"/><Sense id="fw-how-1" synset="fw-interrogative-adv-manner" subcat="InterrogativeAdverb"/></LexicalEntry>
